GunMetal-DX: settings Slipstream renamed when it ported GunMetal-DX v0.3.0 (GMDX* / FS* / OCOL* ->
SL* / RenderVK*), old name -> new name. Read once per settings file (marker GMDXSettingsRenamed) by
SLSettingsMigration::migrateGMDXRenames (slsettingsmigration.cpp): a value saved under an old name in
user_settings/settings.xml or an account's settings_per_account.xml is carried to the new name while
the new one is still at its default. The OTS* camera settings are not here: upstream's
migrateTPSFraming carries them to SlipstreamTPS*.
-->
